        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCSOL19, Soleil Knob with Arc Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate is a unique way to add character to your home. The Soleil Knob has a style that is all its own, while the Arc Tall plate adds a traditional look that brings appearance the of the knobset together. The Arc Tall Plate with Soleil Knob is great for bigger doors. It is 11 inches tall and 2.5 inches wide. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/soleil-knob-with-arc-tall-plate-single-cylinder-entryset-grandeur-arcsol19entr\"><b>Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate Single Cylinder Entryset</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/soleil-knobset-with-arc-plate-grandeur-arcsol\"><b>Soleil Knobset with Arc Short Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Soleil Knob with Arc Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Soleil Knob with Arched Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCSOL19-specifications.pdf?v=1704262390\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCSOL19 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
