                "title": "Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate",
                "description": "The Soleil Knob with Arc Tall Plate is a unique way to add character to your home. The Soleil Knob has a style that is all its own, while the Arc Tall plate adds a traditional look that brings appearance the of the knobset together. The Arc Tall Plate with Soleil Knob is great for bigger doors. It is 11 inches tall and 2.5 inches wide. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
